{
 "about": "requestAttributes of a GENERAL PIP with a placeholder no golden sent: pipCalls records what the call carried. Each route answers [\"v\"], and each probe is `subject.X == 'v' OR resource.a == 'y'`, so a = n is true whatever the attributes.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R35G_",
